{"pageid": 764, "title": "Ms. Mahoney", "revid": 1826, "categories": ["Characters", "Humans", "Archer's Peak", "Unnamed characters", "Characters (SIKTC comics)"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Ms. Mahoney</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/dc/MsMahoney2.png/revision/latest?cb=20241215165100\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"MsMahoney2\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/dc/MsMahoney2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215165100\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/dc/MsMahoney2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215165100 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/dc/MsMahoney2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20241215165100 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"MsMahoney2\" width=\"270\" height=\"222\" data-image-key=\"MsMahoney2.png\" data-image-name=\"MsMahoney2.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Alive</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatives\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Relatives</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mr._Mahoney\" title=\"Mr. Mahoney\">Mr. Mahoney</a> <small>(estranged husband)</small><p><a href=\"/wiki/Tommy_Mahoney\" title=\"Tommy Mahoney\">Tommy Mahoney</a> <small>(son)</small><a href=\"/wiki/Sophie_Mahoney\" title=\"Sophie Mahoney\">Sophie Mahoney</a> † <small>(daughter)</small></p></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_2\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 2\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #2</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_15\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 15\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #15</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote class=\"pull-quote\">\n\t<div class=\"pull-quote&#95;&#95;text\">I'm not leaving, <a href=\"/wiki/Tommy_Mahoney\" title=\"Tommy Mahoney\">Tommy</a>. I'm not going anywhere until I say goodbye to <a href=\"/wiki/Sophie_Mahoney\" title=\"Sophie Mahoney\">my little girl</a>.</div>\n\t<p style=\"text-align: right\"><cite>—Ms. Mahoney to Tommy Mahoney, <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_7\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 7\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #7</a></cite></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><b>Ms. Mahoney</b> is the mother of <a href=\"/wiki/Tommy_Mahoney\" title=\"Tommy Mahoney\">Tommy</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Sophie_Mahoney\" title=\"Sophie Mahoney\">Sophie Mahoney</a>, the latter of whom was kidnapped and killed by an <a href=\"/wiki/Oscuratypes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Oscuratypes\">Oscuratype</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Monster\" title=\"Monster\">monster</a>. Distraught over the death, Ms. Mahoney became angry, suicidal, and addicted to cigarettes. Her son, Tommy, would later take responsibility for the deaths in order to protect her and the rest of the town from being killed by the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>TBA\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Physical_appearance\">Physical appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Ms. Mahoney is an older Caucasian woman with blue eyes and brown hair.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_2\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 2\">Issue #2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_7\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 7\">Issue #7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_8\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 8\">Issue #8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_9\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 9\">Issue #9</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_10\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 10\">Issue #10</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_11\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 11\">Issue #11</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_13\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 13\">Issue #13</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_14\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 14\">Issue #14</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_15\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 15\">Issue #15</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"b8c14aeae80f7ccfa6ae33c1c71fb690\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:154px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"MsMahoney2-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:152px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:MsMahoney2.png\" title=\"MsMahoney2.png (1.44 MB)\" style=\"height:152px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/dc/MsMahoney2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20241215165100\" ti